ty in them all of them live  simple lives in different parts of the  city however moe's past seems  interesting to her it is revealed that  he formed a famous martial arts club and  was a teacher before his imprisonment  the club has thousands of followers in  present day he was also recruited by the  hong kong police as a martial arts  instructor as the detectives talk they  get the news about king yi's death  detective luck is shocked that moe's  prediction turned out to be true the  very next day mo is led out of the  prison temporarily under police custody  by inspecting the order of killings mo  has realized that the killer is  targeting his victims by following a  martial arts practice first he killed  the boxer who used his hands then king  yi who used his legs to fight so his  next target will probably be hitmontop i  mean someone who wrestles moe knows a  wrestler among the remaining six people  but yusao gets to the man before the  police when the police arrive at the  location they see the wrestler's body  being thrown from a window he also has a  similar dagger stabbed into his arm  suddenly moe looks at the roof of  another building and sees yusao his evil  smile makes him realize that he is the  murderer mo immediately follows the man  while the police do the same a few  minutes into the chase yusao takes a  leap to the top of a neighboring  building and disappears leaving mo and  the police ashamed that they couldn't  catch him taking the opportunity mo also  escapes from police custody the next day  he goes to his hometown foshon where he  meets his wife xin ying they are happy  to be reunited after three years it is  amazing that the police haven't assumed  this is where he would go she takes him  home and makes him wear a sacred band on  his wrist it is supposed to make him  fight only for self-defense and protect  him from making the same mistake that  got him imprisoned at night mo finds the  killer's dagger in one of the boxes with  his belongings sin ying reveals that a  few months ago a limping man came to  their martial arts school and asked her  to keep the dagger she thinks that the  town's historian might know what the  symbol in the dagger means and the two  decide to go to him the next day then a  flashback shows us yusaw with his late  wife who had cancer she was the only  person in the world who loved and  accepted him as he was while she was  dying he practiced martial arts day and  night to keep himself from thinking  about her inevitable death back in the  present mo and sin ying go to the  historian to find out more about the  dagger it is revealed that the symbol on  it is called eve's swallow during the  rule of the king dynasty it was given to  the person who lost in a martial arts  fight the couple is talking about you  sao when a man nearby overhears them and  claims to know him he says that a few  years ago yusao lived with his cancerous  wife in a nearby town yusao was born  with a disability that makes one of his  legs shorter than the other yet he was  able to master martial arts techniques  with hard work and dedication following  that mo calls detective luck saying that  he has a lead the police immediately  come to the town to receive him and make  their way to the killer's hometown they  arrive at usa's home but see that he has  already moved away the landlady claims  that she never saw yusuf do anything  other than train he also used to rub his  face with salt until it bled to thicken  his skin so it could take a longer  beating then the police find writing on  the wall that says that he has lost  everything in his life and now his only  motive is to fight the best martial  artists and become number one that is  why he has been killing some of the best  fighters and plans to kill more that was  honestly a pretty shallow twist  meanwhile yusao goes to his next target  a former fighter and actor this time he  challenges him to a duel using swords  after a long and fierce match yusau  slits the man's throat and kills him  after yet another death detective luck  is pressured by the higher officials to  solve the case sooner she urges mo to do  the same but he seems to be hiding  something from them once when mo was in  prison he got a letter from yoo sao that  vaguely talked about a challenge back  then mo didn't know what it meant but  now he has realized that he is the final  person usa wants to fight detective luck  also starts to suspect mo and asks the  prison for the cctv footage of every  meeting he has had with an outsider at  night mo is sitting alone in the room  when he remembers the day before the  first murder took place yusao had sent  him a letter asking him to watch the  news the following day the police find  out about yusuf's current address and  send a swat team to his house they  search around it but find no one inside  just as they are about to leave they see  that his wife's ashes are still there  which means he will definitely return to  retrieve them detective luck orders a  redeployment and makes the police stay  hidden until yusau returns to the house  the next morning he is seen approaching  the house on a boat a flashback shows  that his wife was struggling severely  before her death yusao couldn't see her  in such a condition anymore so he mercy  killed her by strangling her to death  that twist was a little more intense in  the present the police see him and  cautiously wait for him to come closer  so they can attack all at once however  you sound notices guard dogs around the  neighborhood and takes a random turn  before anyone knows where he went he is  gone somewhere else an officer  investigating the cctv footage from the  prison finds out that yusao had come to  meet mo while he was in prison detective  locke points her gun at him believing  that the killings were his and yusau's  plan to get him out of prison meanwhile  sin ying has set off to look for yusao  on her own mo swiftly gets hold of the  gun from 