au  slits the man's throat and kills him  after yet another death detective luck  is pressured by the higher officials to  solve the case sooner she urges mo to do  the same but he seems to be hiding  something from them once when mo was in  prison he got a letter from yoo sao that  vaguely talked about a challenge back  then mo didn't know what it meant but  now he has realized that he is the final  person usa wants to fight detective luck  also starts to suspect mo and asks the  prison for the cctv footage of every  meeting he has had with an outsider at  night mo is sitting alone in the room  when he remembers the day before the  first murder took place yusao had sent  him a letter asking him to watch the  news the following day the police find  out about yusuf's current address and  send a swat team to his house they  search around it but find no one inside  just as they are about to leave they see  that his wife's ashes are still there  which means he will definitely return to  retrieve them detective luck orders a  redeployment and makes the police stay  hidden until yusau returns to the house  the next morning he is seen approaching  the house on a boat a flashback shows  that his wife was struggling severely  before her death yusao couldn't see her  in such a condition anymore so he mercy  killed her by strangling her to death  that twist was a little more intense in  the present the police see him and  cautiously wait for him to come closer  so they can attack all at once however  you sound notices guard dogs around the  neighborhood and takes a random turn  before anyone knows where he went he is  gone somewhere else an officer  investigating the cctv footage from the  prison finds out that yusao had come to  meet mo while he was in prison detective  locke points her gun at him believing  that the killings were his and yusau's  plan to get him out of prison meanwhile  sin ying has set off to look for yusao  on her own mo swiftly gets hold of the  gun from 