 by a vehicle following that they get  a hold of bamboo sticks and fight using  those eventually the bamboos also break  so they fist fight again suddenly mo  ends up under a car that drags him a  little further it is enough to knock him  unconscious taking his opportunity yuso  drags him to the other side of the road  he is about to kill mo but detective  luck arrives at the right time and  shoots him dead in the end mo is taken  to the hospital three months after the  incident he is in prison again detective  luck comes for a visit and informs him  that he is being bailed out shortly in  the last scene we see mo and xin yang  taking pictures with the students from  their school of martial arts subscribe  for more videos like this turn on  notifications and leave a like to help  the channel out thank you for watching


